nde minaccia è la nostra unica speranza."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"In the future, a strange fungus has changed nearly everyone into thoughtless, flesh-eating monsters. When a scientist and a teacher find a girl who seems to be immune to the fungus, they all begin a journey to save humanity.","tagline":"Our greatest threat is our only hope."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gMJiCjMansWCW32b8JJw3KLDuTv.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rrAMFTuTFHYI6INtyPnOYyoGTO2.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":375366,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gMJiCjMansWCW32b8JJw3KLDuTv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gMJiCjMansWCW32b8JJw3KLDuTv.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gMJiCjMansWCW32b8JJw3KLDuTv.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gMJiCjMansWCW32b8JJw3KLDuTv.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/thlZZBedaP03SP3AvhWGkGj8ltU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/thlZZBedaP03SP3AvhWGkGj8ltU.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dGgn0ye4LlmNbdxJaye3gnTZRre.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dGgn0ye4LlmNbdxJaye3gnTZRre.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dcmexRa4HEgraKg8RKaV4Wn1hxS.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dcmexRa4HEgraKg8RKaV4Wn1hxS.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rwKvnlC7EMIsjlHbEw4w4X8JUYP.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rwK